<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the final day of</p>
<p>the second test between Sri Lanka and Pakistan on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings 331 (A.de Silva 138 not out,</p>
<p>S.Jayasuriya 72)</p>
<p>Pakistan first innings 292 (Moin Khan 98; S.de Silva 5-85,</p>
<p>C.Vaas 4-60)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka second innings 386-4 declared (S.Jayasuriya 133,</p>
<p>A.de Silva 103 not out)</p>
<p>Pakistan second innings (overnight 28-2)</p>
<p> R.Raja c Kaluwitharana b Vaas		   0</p>
<p> S.Elahi c Arnold b Vaas			  14</p>
<p> I.Ahmed c Vaas b J.Silva			 47</p>
<p> S.Malik c Kaluwitharana b J.Silva	   155</p>
<p> Inzam-ul-Haq not out			     54</p>
<p> A.Mujtaba c Ranatunga b Atapattu		6</p>
<p> S.Mushtaq not out				   5</p>
<p> Extras (lb-3 nb-1)				  4</p>
<p> Total: (for five wickets)		     285</p>
<p>Bowling: Vaas 16-7-40-2, S. de Silva 19-2-73-0,</p>
<p>J.Silva 28-10-71-2, Kalpage 20-6-60-0, Atapattu 4-0-9-1,</p>
<p>Tillekeratne 2-1-3-0, Arnold 6-0-26-0 (1nb)</p>
<p>Result: Match drawn</p>
<p>Man of the match: Aravinda de Silva</p>
<p>Man of the series: Aravinda de Silva</p>
<p>First test: Colombo - Match drawn</p>
</text>
